.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt LS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm ls
.Nd list directory contents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl alh
.Op Ar path ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility lists directory entries sorted by name.
Without a
.Ar path ,
the current directory is listed.
Directories get a trailing
.Sq /
in short listings.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
Include names beginning with a dot.
.It Fl h
Accepted for compatibility; sizes are printed in bytes.
.It Fl l
Print the mode string, size and name.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cat 1 ,
.Xr stat 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
